        "text_XjJfbp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Gotham Studios Melbourne is a leading online prepaid photography service supplying high-end photography to B2B clients worldwide. But beyond being a studio, it takes pride in supporting visual artists, especially in the field of photography. </p><p>The Gotham Studios Collective is returning to the Affordable Art Fair, marking our 6th year with the fair and a homecoming to the city where it all began. This August, we’re bringing a refreshed stand, new perspectives, and a growing community of artists, anchored by a lineup that brings together returning favourites and a new wave of talent joining the Collective for the first time.</p>",
            "style": "text"
          }
        },
