      "blocks": {
        "slide_RBpBPb": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gotham_Studios_Collective_Sheng_Yi_Lee_Artist_Portrait_Photographer_Valerie_Bong.jpg",
            "subheading": "ARTIST FEATURE",
            "title": "Sheng Yi Lee",
            "text": "<p>Sheng Yi’s journey began with a pencil and a growing obsession with black-and-white realism. When she picked up a brush, her world opened into colour. Working across large formats, she has since developed two celebrated collections: Food Portrait, which finds quiet beauty in the natural forms and personalities of fruits and vegetables; and Life According to George, a joyful return to the playful imagination of childhood. For Sheng Yi, art should delight. It should draw you in and hold you in its story.</p>",
