    "hero_jMfwdG": {
      "type": "hero",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_F434YT": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Sebnem_Gencer_Gotham_Studios_Collective.jpg",
            "subheading": "ARTIST FEATURE",
            "title": "Sebnem Gencer",
            "text": "<p>For Şebnem, painting a cityscape is never simply an exercise in observation. It’s an act of memory. Her canvases hold moments, loves, losses, and the quiet experiences that leave a permanent mark. Through richly layered cityscapes, she creates spaces where viewers can find their own stories reflected back, wrapped in the same embrace that art has always offered her.</p>",
